WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:37.187 --> 00:00:38.730
I have a job for you.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.023
Piece of cake really.

00:00:42.974 --> 00:00:43.975
Gimme your hand.

00:00:47.663 --> 00:00:48.664
It's a security gig.

00:00:51.942 --> 00:00:53.193
Hello?

00:00:54.741 --> 00:00:56.449
Welcome to Freddy's.

00:00:56.449 --> 00:00:57.450
Have you
met them yet?

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.726
Met who?

00:01:02.364 --> 00:01:03.907
Foxy.

00:01:03.907 --> 00:01:05.033
Bonnie.

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:06.117
Chica.

00:01:06.117 --> 00:01:07.118
And...Freddy.

00:01:11.714 --> 00:01:12.882
Back in the eighties,

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.734
some kids went missing.

00:01:15.734 --> 00:01:17.069
What is this?

00:01:17.069 --> 00:01:18.195
That's why the
place shut down.

00:01:19.927 --> 00:01:21.137
The police
searched Freddy's.

00:01:21.137 --> 00:01:22.138
Hey!

00:01:22.138 --> 00:01:23.431
They never found the kids.

00:01:25.346 --> 00:01:26.805
What the heck?

00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:39.709
Ghost children

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.376
possessing giant robots?

00:01:43.918 --> 00:01:45.170
Tell me how to stop them.

00:01:46.197 --> 00:01:48.241
You don't!

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:51.327
It's too late. He's coming.

